---
import FeatureCard from '@components/ui/FeatureCard.astro'
---

<section class="what-is" id="what-is" aria-labelledby="what-is-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <p class="eyebrow">What Voxivium changes</p>
      <h2 id="what-is-heading">
        A non-partisan bridge between citizens and the people who represent them.
      </h2>
      <p class="lead">
        When the verified positions of millions of voters are aggregated and weighted by what they
        care about, two things become possible: voters discover common ground they never knew existed, 
        and politicians get a mandate they can actually govern by.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid">
      <FeatureCard title="For voters: proof you're not alone">
        <p>
          State your positions on the issues that matter. See how often each representative supports
          the issues you care about, and discover how much your district already agrees on issues 
          you've been told are too divisive to discuss.
        </p>
      </FeatureCard>

      <FeatureCard title="For politicians: a real mandate">
        <p>
          See what the verified citizens of your district actually want, weighted by what they care
          about most. Govern from a measurable signal instead of donor pressure or primary noise.
        </p>
      </FeatureCard>

      <FeatureCard title="Verified, never sold">
        <p>
          Every Voxivium user is a confirmed registered U.S. voter. Individual positions are never
          tied to your name and never sold. The platform reports the aggregated voice of the
          citizens, never the citizen.
        </p>
      </FeatureCard>

      <FeatureCard title="A Public Benefit Corporation">
        <p>
          Our charter legally requires the mission to come first. Our bylaws codify a 5:1 executive
          pay ratio, a living wage for every employee, and profit sharing across the company.
        </p>
      </FeatureCard>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .what-is {
    padding: clamp(4rem, 10vh, 6rem) 1.5rem;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 72rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  header {
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--color-brand-primary);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.875rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-brand-text1);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.15;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .lead {
    margin: 1.25rem auto 0;
    max-width: 40rem;
    color: var(--color-brand-text3);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
